== Tips ==
* In most circumstances, a '''Dwarf Turtle Shelmet''' is unnecessary as the {{Attr|Shell}} [[Attribute]] does not need to be equipped to a [[Pet]]; in addition, playing as the [[Tank]] class in [[Dungeons]] also gives  {{stat|kb}} immunity. However, its {{Stat|td|+10}} can prove useful in circumstances.
** Using the {{Item|Slime Hat}} is also an alternative, although it replaces the [[Helmet]].

== Trivia ==
* The '''Dwarf Turtle Shelmet''' used to be the only [[Pet Items|Pet Item]] in the game to not give any stat bonuses. 
* Although it is not normally possible to obtain a '''Dwarf Turtle Shelmet''' inside the [[Rift Dimension]], if a player manages to do so anyway and apply it to their {{Item|Montezuma Pet}}, it will actually grant them immunity to knockback. However, the pet item gets wiped once the player leaves the Rift.

